      "description": "Create a new image from a text prompt, optionally guided by reference images for style, identity, composition, or material. Use this by default for new visuals; for a small change to an existing image, use edit_image instead; if intent is unclear, ask the user first. Usage: returns a task_id immediately — poll check_image_task until status is done (saved_path holds the output file) or failed.",
      "inputSchema": {
